(text "V2.0 THT PILOT ONLY: MC34063ABN DIP8 boost ~28V -> LM317T TO220 ~20V -> R926/C928 analog filter.\nInput +13V8_PROTECTED is from V1.9 Q801 power cut-off; no vehicle/long transient qualification.\nU911 p1 switch, p2 GND, p3 CT, p4 GND, p5 FB, p6 VCC, p7 Ipk, p8 driver collector.\nU912 p1 ADJ, p2 OUTPUT/TAB (not GND), p3 INPUT. R927 explicit min-load candidate.\nL920 680uH Bourns THT footprint UNSELECTED; switching EMI/RF coupling, saturation, current, boot,\nboost/317 dropout and protection diode polarities NOT proven by vendor model or hardware. NO FAB / NO TX." (at 199.39 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "c020bcd1-faae-4e37-bf20-000000000203"))
